          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"parte-b\">Parte b</h1>\n<h2 id=\"inducao-x-times-y-z-a-times-b\">Indu\u00e7\u00e3o <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x \\times y + z = a \\times b||)</marimo-tex></h2>\n<h2 id=\"0-inducao\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(0||)</marimo-tex>-Indu\u00e7\u00e3o</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Para todo o estado <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x||)</marimo-tex></span>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>(a) <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\neg\\,P(x)||)</marimo-tex>  \u00e9  inconsistente</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(1||)</marimo-tex>-Indu\u00e7\u00e3o</span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Para todo par de estados <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x,y||)</marimo-tex> deve-se verificar:</span>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>(a) <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\quad\\mathsf{init}(x)\\,\\land\\,\\neg P(x)\\quad||)</marimo-tex>  \u00e9  inconsistente</li>\n<li>(b) <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\quad\\mathsf{trans}(x,y) \\,\\land\\, P(x)\\,\\land\\,\\neg\\,P(y)\\quad||)</marimo-tex> \u00e9 inconsistente</li>\n</ul></span>"
